---
description: Definition of done
alwaysApply: true
---
Test happy path, failure path, and authorization boundary. New/changed pure logic must include side-by-side Vitest **behavior** unit tests (real outputs/errors from business rules — not mock call-shape; see `07-testing.mdc`). Run available typecheck/lint/tests. Review diff for unrelated edits, secrets, dead code, duplicate logic. Report exact commands/results. If checks could not run, say so. Don't silently skip failing checks.
